3. Upstream sources
-------------------
Derived scores are own work. The inputs they are derived from keep their own
licences and are cited per axis in the codebook and in the served methodology:

  WRI Aqueduct 4.0 .......... CC-BY 4.0
  Ember Electricity Data .... CC-BY 4.0
  World Bank ................ CC-BY 4.0
  Eurostat .................. open, attribution required
  OECD TiVA ................. open, attribution required
  EMODnet ................... open, attribution required
  ITU GCI ................... open with conditions
  TeleGeography ............. proprietary

TeleGeography material is proprietary and appears here only as derived
aggregates. Raw cable registry data is not published in this repository and
must not be reconstructed from it. Cloud-provider audit reports (SOC, ISO) are
cited by existence only and are never redistributed.
